Package: rail
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, fuse3, nfs-common, ibverbs-providers
Recommends: railfs-dkms
Description: filesystem over RDMA
 rail serves a directory over RDMA or TCP and mounts it as a local path
 through the kernel module, FUSE or an NFS gateway. It also carries files
 directly with rsync's delta algorithm over an ssh control channel.
 .
 This package holds the daemon, the rail command and the mount helpers.

Package: railfs-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms
Description: filesystem over RDMA - kernel module source
 The railfs kernel module, built for the running kernel by DKMS.
